{
  "operators": [
    {
      "name": "multihead_attention_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "query",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch, seq_len, embed_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "key",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch, seq_len, embed_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "value",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch, seq_len, embed_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "in_proj_weight",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[3*embed_dim, embed_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "in_proj_bias",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[3*embed_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "out_proj_weight",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[embed_dim, embed_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "out_proj_bias",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[embed_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "num_heads",
          "kind": "int",
          "default": null,
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "batch_first",
          "kind": "bool",
          "default": null,
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tuple",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "tensor",
            "dtype": "torch.float32",
            "device": "cuda",
            "shape": "[batch, seq_len, embed_dim]",
            "layout": "contiguous"
          },
          {
            "type": "tensor",
            "dtype": "torch.float32",
            "device": "cuda",
            "shape": "[batch, seq_len, seq_len]",
            "layout": "contiguous"
          }
        ]
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 attn_output, attn_output_weights = self.multihead_attn(query, key, value)。",
        "使用 cuDNN 卷积/GEMM 实现线性投影；实际 bias 存在，必须应用 in_proj_bias 和 out_proj_bias。",
        "batch_first=True 时输入形状为 [batch, seq_len, embed_dim]，内部转换为 [seq_len, batch, embed_dim] 进行注意力计算，输出再转回 [batch, seq_len, embed_dim]。",
        "注意力权重按照参考 average_attn_weights=True 对 num_heads 维求平均，形状为 [batch, seq_len, seq_len]。",
        "softmax 在最后一维（key 序列长度）上计算，无 mask。",
        "返回容器为 tuple，与参考一致。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "concat_dim2",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "tensor1",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch, seq_len, embed_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "tensor2",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch, seq_len, embed_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[batch, seq_len, 2*embed_dim]",
        "layout": "contiguous"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 cat_output = torch.cat([attn_output, query], dim=2)。",
        "沿 dim=2 拼接，输出形状 [batch, seq_len, 2*embed_dim]，顺序为先 attn_output 后 query。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "smooth_l1_loss",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "input",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch, seq_len, 2*embed_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "target",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch, seq_len, 2*embed_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "beta",
          "kind": "float",
          "default": 1.0,
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": true
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[]",
        "layout": "contiguous"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 loss = F.smooth_l1_loss(cat_output, self.loss_target)。",
        "reduction='mean'，beta=1.0，输出标量。",
        "计算每个元素 smooth L1：若 |x-y| < beta 则 0.5*(x-y)^2/beta，否则 |x-y| - 0.5*beta，然后取所有元素平均。",
        "beta 参数必须显式传入，默认值为 1.0。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "attn_output, attn_output_weights = self.multihead_attn(query, key, value)",
      "semantics": [
        "调用 nn.MultiheadAttention，batch_first=True，无 mask，average_attn_weights=True。",
        "输出 attn_output 形状 [16,1024,256]，attn_output_weights 形状 [16,1024,1024]，均为 float32 CUDA。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "cat_output = torch.cat([attn_output, query], dim=2)",
      "semantics": [
        "沿特征维拼接 attn_output 和 query，输出形状 [16,1024,512]，float32 CUDA。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "loss = F.smooth_l1_loss(cat_output, self.loss_target)",
      "semantics": [
        "计算 smooth L1 loss，reduction='mean'，输出标量形状 []，float32 CUDA。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_004",
      "source": "return (cat_output, attn_output_weights, loss)",
      "semantics": [
        "返回三元组，顺序为 cat_output、attn_output_weights、loss，与参考完全一致。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}